  user: You are an expert autonomous software engineer tasked with fixing a bug in this repository.

Issue Title: fix(agent): Reasoning and Acting each consume one max_iters iteration since v2.0.5

Description:
## Description

Hello AgentScope maintainers, and thank you for your work on the project.

